 "comments_total": "23",
 "comment_1": "SAMPLE Honestly these were gone from our kitchen by Wednesday afternoon, which is a shame because I only got one bag and I wanted to bring one home for my partner, who eats salty snacks all day and is always looking for something that isn't rice cakes or those puffed things. I'd buy a box if the price is close to what I pay for chips at the deli downstairs, and I'd like a bigger bag, maybe a family size, for the weekend.",
 "comment_2": "SAMPLE Good crunch and not too salty, but I was a bit confused by the card because I thought the QR code was for ordering more for the office, not for a survey, so I almost didn't scan it at all. Maybe say on the front that it's three questions and takes 20 seconds, and that it goes to the people who make it. Also the bag was hard to open with one hand, which matters at a desk.",
 "comment_3": "SAMPLE Not for me, the texture was a little dry and it stuck to my teeth, and I usually go for something sweeter in the afternoon. My two teammates liked it a lot though, and one of them asked me where the store was, so the line on the card about where to find it was actually useful. Would try a different flavor if you bring one, maybe something with rosemary or a little heat, honestly.",
 "code_redemptions_to_date": "14",
