 "retailer_velocity": "",
 "learned": "SAMPLE Offices F and H ran out before day 5 even after top-ups, and office D placed a day late because the pantry owner was out; size units to Tuesday headcount and confirm a backup receiver.\nSAMPLE Seven people said it was gone by the time they looked, so supply, not interest, limited trial in two offices; the 10% reserve was not enough for the larger offices.\nSAMPLE Several people read the QR as a reorder link; the card could say \"three questions, 20 seconds\" beside the code, and the bag is hard to open one-handed.",
 "recommendation": "SAMPLE Renew into offices A, F and H with 20% more units each, and add two new offices in NoMad. Keep the card, add \"three questions, 20 seconds\" beside the QR, and consider the larger bag that two comments asked for before the next drop.",
